# SOP Lang of the scenario "Shape zoo" (docs/js/scenarios.js, id zoo), one block per message.
# Generation model: Claude Opus 5.5 (claude-opus-5-5), 2026-11-04. Format and rules: ../CONVENTIONS.md.

## turn 1
# input: Draw a red circle, an orange square, a yellow rectangle, a green triangle, a teal diamond, a blue ellipse, a purple hexagon and a pink star.
@c1 command action=create shape=circle color=red
@c2 command action=create shape=square color=orange
@c3 command action=create shape=rectangle color=yellow
@c4 command action=create shape=triangle color=green
@c5 command action=create shape=diamond color=teal
@c6 command action=create shape=ellipse color=blue
@c7 command action=create shape=hexagon color=purple
@c8 command action=create shape=star color=pink

## turn 2
# input: Arrange everything in a row.
@c1 command action=arrange layout=row

## turn 3
# input: How many shapes are there?
#! scope: counts the shapes of the whole canvas (every area, the opening drawing's items too), not only the eight of this scenario
@q1 question ask=count shape=any
